  <section class="our-origins">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Our origins</h2>
    <p>
      In a quiet corner of the world, where opportunities were few and resources limited, one spark changed everything — a connection to the internet. What started as a simple interest in computers soon became a doorway to discovery.
    </p>
    <p>
      Through hours of self-learning and endless curiosity, a passion for technology was born — not just to understand it, but to use it to empower others. Today, that journey continues with a mission: to make learning simple, practical, and within reach for anyone eager to grow.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="how-we-started">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="started-content">
      <div class="started-image">
        <img src="https://djgeqya1wekbj.cloudfront.net/product-images/600-600/ECDL-1200x600.jpg.webp" alt="How we started image" />
      </div>
      <div class="started-text">
        <h2>Behind The Platform</h2>
        <p>
         What began as a simple desire to learn turned into a mission to share knowledge with others. With just a laptop, internet access, and a passion for coding, we built our first project—step by step, mistake by mistake. That journey shaped our belief: learning should be accessible, practical, and empowering for everyone.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact-form-section">
  <div class="form-container">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <form action="#" method="post">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="username">Your Name</label>
        <input type="text" id="username" name="username" required />
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="email">Email ID</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required />
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="phone">Phone Number</label>
        <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required />
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="message">Your Message</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea>
      </div>

      <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="help-support">
  <div class="container">
    <p>
      Check out our <a href="#">Help and Support</a> center to find quick answers to your questions.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-container">

    <!-- Left Side -->
    <div class="top">


     
        
      

          {{# output.loggedinuser }}
          
